during dinner.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
One time, my cousin got caught
wearing ankle weights."

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, come on.
-"Eh, no, no, no.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:21.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pull your pants up.
Uh-oh!"

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.255 line:92%
That's kind of a fun bit.

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:25.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from @sweatybetty
-Oh.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:28.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She says, "Every Thanksgiving
to avoid talking politics,

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:31.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
