00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:31.344 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you."

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:35.415 line:92%
This one's from @Williamtmyers1.

00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:37.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says, "My family used to ge
